error[E5007]: the parameter 'it' cannot escape
  --> main.prism:6:18
    6 |     now { keepIt(it) }
      |                  ^^ passed to an escaping parameter here
  --> main.prism:6:9
    6 |     now { keepIt(it) }
      |         ^ 'it' is a parameter here
   = note: an unmarked function-typed parameter may borrow its caller's variables
   = help: declare it as 'it: escaping () -> Unit' if the function may keep it
